// The stat model: how the stats of every summon are calculated (docs/summon_family_stat_formula_spec.md).
// Every summon of the same natural stars spends the same budget of BVP (Base Value Points), and its
// role decides where:
//   BVP = HP / hp_weight + ATK + DEF + SPD × spd_weight
// "stat_budget" is the budget per natural stars; "awakened_stat_budget" is the budget after the
// Awakening (its own budget, not a multiplier). "role_profiles" gives, per natural stars and role, the
// shares of the budget left after Speed (HP, Attack and Defense; they are normalized) and the base
// Speed. "element_bias" multiplies those shares and adds Speed per element: it moves stats around and
// never adds any. "awakening_spd" is the Speed the Awakening adds. "base_stats" are the four stats
// outside the budget, equal for every monster: they don't grow with level.
// These are balance knobs. Change them here or in the "Modelo" tab of docs/summon_family_builder.html;
// then open the project folder in the builder and use "Recalcular todas". The stats stored in
// Data/summons/*_family.json and Data/enemies.json are final numbers at 6★ level 40: the game does not
// calculate them, it only checks them against this file (Core/Content/StatModel.cs).
